**PART V: API SPECIFICATION**

**5.1 Unified Soulpi API**

\@app.post(\"/soulpi/analyze\")

def soulpi_analyze(

text: str,

mode: str = \"v2.7\", \# \"v2.6\", \"v2.7\", \"hybrid\"

HD: float = 0.0,

HG: float = 0.0,

HK: float = 0.0

) -\> dict:

\"\"\"

Unified Soulpi analysis endpoint.

Modes:

\- v2.6: Enterprise stitching only

\- v2.7: Full psycho-spiritual analysis

\- hybrid: Both (v2.6 + v2.7 side-by-side)

\"\"\"

if mode == \"v2.6\":

return stitch_sentence_v26(text, HD=HD, HG=HG, HK=HK)

elif mode == \"v2.7\":

return analyze_sentence_v27(text, HD=HD, HG=HG, HK=HK)

elif mode == \"hybrid\":

return {

\'v2_6\': stitch_sentence_v26(text, HD=HD, HG=HG, HK=HK),

\'v2_7\': analyze_sentence_v27(text, HD=HD, HG=HG, HK=HK)

}

else:

raise ValueError(f\"Invalid mode: {mode}\")

**5.2 Example API Calls**

**v2.6 Enterprise Mode:**

curl -X POST \"https://api.soulpi.com/analyze\" \\

-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\

-d \'{

